---

## Business Value

By understanding customer Intelligence, Engagement and behavior, organizations can make more informed decisions regarding retention strategies, customer experience improvements, and marketing investments.

The insights generated from this project support long-term business growth by helping organizations identify valuable customers, improve engagement, and maximize customer lifetime value.

---

## Conclusion

This project successfully demonstrates how customer behavior analytics and user engagement analysis can be used to generate actionable business insights. Through SQL, Python, and Power BI, raw transactional data was transformed into meaningful intelligence that supports customer-focused decision-making and business growth.
